{%- comment -%}
  Author box at the end of every guide. The byline name comes from the article's author field
  (set by build_guides.py AUTHOR); this bio is the one place it is written for guides. Keep it
  matching the "Who writes the guides" section of the About page.
{%- endcomment -%}
<aside class="hih-author" aria-label="About the author">
  <p class="hih-author__name">Written by {{ name | escape }}</p>
  <p class="hih-author__bio">{{ name | escape }} writes and updates Home Improvement Hub's guides. Each one is checked against manufacturer instructions, building-code basics and official sources, and says when to call a licensed pro. <a href="/pages/about#author">How we write our guides</a></p>
</aside>
